menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_ENGLISH_COURSE
    bool "Enable English course cache and practice log"
    default y
    help
        Caches a bounded English lesson catalog (words and sentence patterns)
        and a bounded local practice-attempt log with pronunciation scores. The
        device can keep the lessons and the child's practice offline and echo
        the scores in the parent app's English learning view.

endmenu
